Swindon is a large town in the county of Wiltshire, South West England, about 126 kilometres or 78 miles west of London. With a population of about 185,000 people, it has one of the lower crime rates in the country. Sharno Callahan was a 22-year-old woman who resided in Swindon with her boyfriend, Kevin Reap. Sharn was a bubbly, friendly, caring and loving girl, instantly likable, beautiful and considerate. On the evening of 18th March 2011, Sharn had a night out with some friends in the old town area of Swindon. They went out for dinner before visiting two bars, the Spot and Baker Street, after which they went to Suju nightclub. At 2.53am on the 19th March, Sharn was captured

