public is at risk, the offender is unknown, and the investigation and securing of evidence requires the allocation of significant resources. And significant resources is what the investigation got. Up to 140 officers were involved. Search teams were immediately mobilised to attend the Savanak Forest. The forest is a densely wooded area with a thick undergrowth, not an easy place to search. Specialist police and dog units were called in. Superintendent Fulcher had three scenarios running through his mind at this early stage of the investigation. One, on leaving the nightclub, Sharn had been either enticed into the vehicle or forcibly abducted into the vehicle seen on the security footage, then driven to the Savanak Forest

